      <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>
      <p className="max-w-md text-center text-slate-600">
        Built with Next.js (App Router), React 19, Sass, Tailwind CSS, Redux
        Toolkit, Axios, Vitest, Testing Library, ESLint, Prettier, Husky,
